##### xbabs_rules.py (docs/bdos/WRABS.md)
  == R-BA-WRABS: WRABS ($30) with DE the first sector, H the count and L 0 (drive A) writes H x 512 bytes from the DTA -- one sector (20), two (21 and 22), the disk's last (1439) -- and answers A 0, HL 0, the DTA left as it was; F $42.
     candidate fails 6 case(s); zerobas fails 0
     e.g. XA D01 f: VG 0x42 | CAND 0x54 | ZB 0x42 | NMS 0x42
     fields: {'ZB=VG': 12, 'ZB=CAND': 6} {'NMS=VG': 12, 'NMS other': 6}
  == R-BA-BACK: Read back with RDABS the sectors hold exactly what WRABS took from the DTA, in order: sector 20 the first 512 bytes of case 1's DTA, sector 22 bytes 512 .. 1023 of case 3's, both of case 3's read together, sector 1439 case 6's; nothing past the H x 512 bytes is touched (+512 / +1024 keep the reading
     candidate fails 8 case(s); zerobas fails 0
     e.g. XA D02 f: VG 0x42 | CAND 0x54 | ZB 0x42 | NMS 0x42
     fields: {'ZB=VG': 32, 'ZB=CAND': 8} {'NMS=VG': 28, 'NMS other': 12}
  == R-BA-MEDIUM: Round 2: what WRABS wrote is ON THE MEDIUM, at the logical sector DE names: PHYDIO ($0144, the BIOS's own sector read, media $F9) reads sector 20, sectors 21 .. 22 and sector 1439 back as exactly the bytes WRABS took from the DTA -- every byte (two order-sensitive sums of each 512-byte half), nothin
     candidate fails 6 case(s); zerobas fails 0
     e.g. XA2 D02 f: VG 0x42 | CAND 0x44 | ZB 0x44 | NMS 0x42
     fields: {'ZB=CAND': 12, 'ZB=VG': 18} {'NMS=VG': 18, 'NMS other': 12}
  == R-BA-ONLY: WRABS writes those sectors and NO other: RDABS of the neighbours -- 19 and 21 around a 1-sector write at 20, 23 after the 2-sector write at 21, 20 again after it, 1438 below 1439 -- reads the empty image's bytes (or case 1's, for 20), every byte. A 0, HL 0, F $42.
     candidate fails 10 case(s); zerobas fails 0
     e.g. XA2 D03 f: VG 0x42 | CAND 0x54 | ZB 0x42 | NMS 0x42
     fields: {'ZB=VG': 50, 'ZB=CAND': 10} {'NMS=VG': 44, 'NMS other': 16}
  == R-BA-WRABS2: Round 2's WRABS: A 0, HL 0, F $42 (Z and N set, the carry clear), the whole DTA left (its sums).
     candidate fails 6 case(s); zerobas fails 0
     e.g. XA2 D01 f: VG 0x42 | CAND 0x54 | ZB 0x42 | NMS 0x42
     fields: {'ZB=VG': 12, 'ZB=CAND': 6} {'NMS=VG': 12, 'NMS other': 6}
  == R-BA-WORK: A, F and HL are the same on both references in every case: SETDTA answers A $08, HL $5808, F 0; WRABS and RDABS F $42; PHYDIO HL = the buffer ($A800), F $42. SETDTA leaves the DTA.
