     fields: {'ZB=VG': 16, 'ZB other': 10, 'ZB=CAND': 6} {'NMS=VG': 32}
  == R-BC-BUFIN: BUFIN ($0A) at DE with 'HI' + Return and a maximum of 10: +1 the count 2, +2 'HI', then the $0D STORED after the text; the rest of the buffer untouched. It echoes 'HI' at the cursor (the 'H' shown as graphic $08: CONIN had echoed the $01 prefix just before) and ends with a carriage return alone (col
     candidate fails 2 case(s); zerobas fails 0
