  == R-BC-HOLD2: Round 2: the hold is ONE place. DIRIO E $FF with nothing held and no key answers A 0. CONST with a key held answers $FF and leaves a new key in the BIOS buffer ('Y' stays); with two keys waiting it takes ONE ('X'; 'Y' stays). Every input call serves the held key first: $07 returns the held 'X' and l
     candidate fails 28 case(s); zerobas fails 20
     e.g. XN2 D01 a: VG 0xff | CAND 0x00 | ZB 0xff | NMS 0xff
