  == R-BC-CTRL: CONIN's echo of control keys: TAB ($09) is expanded with SPACES to the next multiple of 8 (column 2 -> 9, the cells 2 .. 8 written); BS ($08), CTRL+B ($02) and LF ($0A) go to the screen raw -- back one column, nothing shown, down one row with the column kept. A is the key.
