  == R-C-NUM: A numeric-constant token ($0B-$0F, $11-$1D, $1F) returns A = the token, F a logical result's on it (S, Z, bits 5 / 3, P/V even parity; H, N and the carry clear), and HL = $46E6 -- not a pointer into the text.
